{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"spell_stumble_hex","model_identifier":"spell_stumble_hex","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# spell_stumble_hex\n\nGoblin stumble hex: a sickly green ring of crude runes on the ground under one unit (about 1 m across, radius 18 u) and a small green spiral above the unit's head (y 68-74).\n\n- Bounds (first set): x -19..19, y 0..73, z -19..19 units (1.05 x 2.06 x 1.08 m). Origin at the base centre, front faces -Z.\n- Texture: 16 x 32, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering; every visible face has its own region painted with its material at world position (identical faces share one). No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: 28.\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 38 x 73 x 38 (w x h x d), centred at x 0, z 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `loop` | 1.5 | loop | the ground ring turns slowly; the spiral above the head spins fast and bobs |\n\n- Glowing cubes (`glow_*`): glow_ring0, glow_ring1, glow_ring2, glow_ring4, glow_ring5, glow_ring6, glow_ring8, glow_ring9, glow_rune0, glow_rune0_tick, glow_rune1, glow_rune1_tick ...\n\n## Notes\n\n- Bright simple glowing shapes; every lit cube is named `glow_*` (flat colours; the game may scale, spin and fade them). No particles or lights in the file.\n"},"resolution":{"width":16,"height":32},"elements":[{"name":"glow_ring0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[17.25,0.0,-4.5],"to":[18.75,0.6,4.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0,0,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[7.25,19.4,8.75,20.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[4.5,17.4,13.5,18.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[7.25,19.4,8.75,20.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[4.5,17.4,13.5,18.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0.25,0.5,1.75,9.5],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[0.25,0.5,1